bugs.description:
Transient success messages on the project page remain visible after the user moves on to a different workflow.
For example:
- after adding a project member, the member success message remains visible while the user creates a bug;
- after creating a bug, the bug creation success message remains visible while the user adds a member;
- reopening the New Bug form can also display the success message from the previously created bug.
This can result in multiple stale success messages being displayed at the same time and makes it unclear which feedback relates to the user's current action.
